sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Owner (one instruction)
    participant S as Sponsor host (enrolled)
    participant N as New host
    O->>S: "fleet-add host-a"
    S->>N: reach over already-trusted SSH lane
    S->>N: install prerequisites, fleet-init
    N->>N: mint own key
    N-->>S: pubkey + possession-proof signature
    S->>N: remote URL + store_id (data, never pasted)
    S->>S: commit roster line, push
    Note over N: enrollment complete only when commit is on main@origin
    Note over N: policy writes soak 24h; evidence paths live immediately
